⍝ Shape.tc
⍝ ════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: Z simple nonneg integer vector
      ⍝ inv: ⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B   (shape of shape = 1-elem vector with rank)
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ,1   (shape is always a vector)
      B ← ⎕RVAL 3 (2 3 4) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      Z ← ⍴B
      (⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ,1
1
      ⍝ Scalar: shape is empty vector
      (⍴⎕RVAL 0) ≡ ⍳0
1
